    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283245,283282,283319</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>手伝いますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Will you help?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>任せて！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Leave it to us!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……もう……
やる気マンマンだね、
ふたりとも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Jeez... You're both
really getting into this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だって、オレたち</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, yeah, 'cause we're...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279404</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『なりきり士』だもんね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>..."Roleplayers," after all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だね。
よし、行っといで♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So you are. Alright,
then, let's go~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、やってやるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, let's do it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うまくできるかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I hope it goes okay.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレたち、
なりきり士なんだから
だいじょーぶだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, hey, we're Roleplayers,
so I'm sure it'll go fine.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……行こうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほんとうに大丈夫、かな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Will it really, though?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おや、&lt;Cless&gt;さん、
おかえりなさい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, &lt;Cless&gt;.
Welcome back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ただいま。
村の様子はどうですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thanks. How are
things in the village?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ、みんな、なんとか
やっています</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, everyone seems
to be managing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、以前、みんなで
準備した冬のたくわえが
まだ少し不安だったので</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though, we're a little worried
the things we stocked up on
before might not be enough.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>男たちは狩りに出て、
村に残ったものたちは、
畑を作り備えています</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So the grown men have gone
out to hunt and everyone
else is tending to the fields.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……でも、
あまりうまくいってない、
って感じですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And I take it it
doesn't seem to
be going that well?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わかりますか。
そうなんですよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah, you got it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ね、&lt;Cless&gt;さん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Cless&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ん……？
なんだい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm? What is it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレたちになんか
できねーかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Think we could
help out somehow?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>君たちに？　前も
手伝ってもらったからね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You guys? You already
helped us a lot before.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一度も二度も
同じですよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was easy to help once, so
helping twice should be fine.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うーん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Hmmm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お手伝いするって
狩りや畑のお仕事の？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you just need help with
hunting and field work?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……やっぱ……
やめとこうか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Maybe...we shouldn't, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そう、だな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あれ？
どうしたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? What's wrong?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ははっ、いや、
ちょっと不安になって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I just kinda... Feel a little
nervous, all of a sudden...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今はわたしたちも
別のことしないと
いけないし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We have a lot of
other things we still
need to do, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね……
でも、気持ちだけで、
充分、ありがたいよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, that's true...
Well, we're grateful to
know you care, anyway.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>引き続き狩りと畑で
冬の準備をしていますが、
うまくいかないです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're still hard at work on winter
prep, out hunting and in the fields,
but it's not going too well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>絶賛、冬の準備進行中だ。
なかなかはかどらないんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're trying to get our big break as winter prep
superstars, but the talent scouts aren't interested.
...Or in other words, preparations aren't going well...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>not sure if it'll fit. -dragon</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>早くしないと、
雪の降る季節に
なってしまうよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If we don't finish up soon,
the snow will start coming
down before we're done.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
